Description:It is your second main phase. You control Cloudfin Raptor (0/1, evolve) and have Memnite and Grizzly Bears in hand, with two green mana floating. End the turn with two +1/+1 counters on Cloudfin Raptor.
Rule:authored-evolve-order | Evolve compares the entering creature with the evolving creature as it is then, and again on resolution (CR 702.100a-b): Memnite (1/1) first evolves the 0/1 Raptor to 1/2, then Grizzly Bears (2/2) evolves it again; Bears first leaves a 1/2 Raptor that a 1/1 cannot evolve
